From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: openworld-kernel <noreply@openworld>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] virtio_balloon: push pfn batches to a 64 MiB maximum

0005 capped batches at 8192 pfns (32 MiB per round-trip on 4K
pages) because a larger array risks probe-time high-order
allocation failure - which cannot actually happen here: the pfn
array is embedded in struct virtio_balloon (kzalloc'd with the
device at probe, on fresh unfragmented memory), not separately
allocated. So 16384 costs only +32 KiB of static device memory.

64 MiB per tell_host() round-trip:

- a 512 MiB inflate converges in 8 batches instead of 16,
- the OOM drain loop (0009) now covers its 128 MiB budget in 2
  batches instead of 4,
- it pairs with the host-side pfn caps: the Firecracker fork must
  raise MAX_PAGES_IN_DESC/MAX_PAGE_COMPACT_BUFFER to 16384 or it
  rejects the larger descriptors ("bogus page count") and the
  batches silently shrink back to the old 1 MiB effective size.

No behaviour change when the host does not balloon.

Tunable: edit the define below; keep it in sync with the host.

Signed-off-by: openworld-kernel <noreply@openworld>


Signed-off-by: openworld-kernel <noreply@openworld>
---
 drivers/virtio/virtio_balloon.c | 6 ++++--
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/virtio/virtio_balloon.c b/drivers/virtio/virtio_balloon.c
index 123456789036..123456789037 100644
--- a/drivers/virtio/virtio_balloon.c
+++ b/drivers/virtio/virtio_balloon.c
@@ -27,7 +27,13 @@
  * page units.
  */
 #define VIRTIO_BALLOON_PAGES_PER_PAGE (unsigned int)(PAGE_SIZE >> VIRTIO_BALLOON_PFN_SHIFT)
-#define VIRTIO_BALLOON_ARRAY_PFNS_MAX 8192
+/*
+ * Maximum: 64 MiB per inflate/deflate round-trip on 4K pages (16384
+ * pfns, 32x fewer round-trips than stock for a 512 MiB adjustment).
+ * The pfn array is embedded in struct virtio_balloon, so this costs
+ * +32 KiB of static device memory and no probe-time allocation.
+ */
+#define VIRTIO_BALLOON_ARRAY_PFNS_MAX 16384
 /* Maximum number of (4k) pages to deflate on OOM notifications. */
 #define VIRTIO_BALLOON_OOM_NR_PAGES 32768
 #define VIRTIO_BALLOON_OOM_NOTIFY_PRIORITY 80
